[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Heracles Main Control Bootloader FW Software Requirements Specification
UID: DHF-HRC-0015
METADATA:
  COMPONENT: main-control/bootloader

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to provide Software Requirements Specifications for the Heracles Main
Control Bootloader Firmware (FW).
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes all requirements of the Heracles Main Control Bootloader FW.
The information in this document has been derived from the VoxelRay Heracles Product Requirements
Specification, as referenced in this document.

\*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware systems.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
FW
  Firmware

MCU
  Microcontroller Unit

PRS
  Product Requirements Specification

SDP
  Software Development Plan

SRS
  Software Requirements Specification

SW
  Software
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The Main Control Bootloader firmware allows the system to update the main control application
firmware.

The Main Board Bootloader firmware runs on the main control MCU of the main control board.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: References

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
EMS-WI-057-13: Generating Documents and Traceability Matrix Analysis in Ketryx WI

EMS-SOP-057: Software Design Control

DHF-HRC-0001, Rev. 2: Heracles Software Development Plan (SDP)

DHF-HRC-0002: VoxelRay Product Requirements Specification (PRS)
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
PREFIX: RQ-H1FWMCBOOT-
TITLE: Requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWMCBOOT-1
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Functional
STATEMENT: >>>
The main control bootloader firmware shall jump to execution of the main application if and only
if the existing main application code at startup is valid. The main application code is valid if the
programmed CRC value matches the application firmware loaded in flash memory.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWMCBOOT-3
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Functional
STATEMENT: >>>
The main control bootloader firmware shall be able to write a specified flash memory page with
provided data from the PC
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWMCBOOT-4
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Functional
STATEMENT: >>>
The main control bootloader firmware shall be able to erase a predetermined area of flash
memory, corresponding to the application firmware programming area.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FWMCBOOT-5
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: PC Communication Ping Response
STATEMENT: >>>
The main control bootloader firmware shall be able to respond to a ping command from the PC,
indicating that the system is in bootloader mode.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]
